<Layout title="Membership | Kin & Campus">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Membership</div><h1>A hundred and nineteen a month while they're on campus.</h1><p class="lead">One seat for the academic year. A local pediatrician who already knows them. $1,190 billed August–May, or $119 a month for ten months.</p></div>
<div class="w"><div class="price"><div class="card"><h3>School year</h3><div class="big">$119/mo</div><p>August through May. Direct access, visits, check-ins, a letter home.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Academic year</h3><div class="big">$1,190</div><p>Billed once for the year they’re in Blacksburg. A panel small enough that same-day is real.</p></div></div></div>
<section style="padding-top:24px"><div class="w"><div class="price"><div class="card"><h3>Inside the year</h3><p>Office visits, usually same day. Direct physician text. Check-ins around holidays, finals, and the week back from break. Letters to the hometown physician. Medication continuity. Forms for travel, housing, and athletics. Tele visits when a room is not required.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Outside the year</h3><p>Emergency departments and hospitalizations. Specialty care and imaging — we arrange them. This website is not a chart. Membership is not insurance; keep coverage for labs, specialists, and emergencies.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section><div class="w"><h2 style="margin-bottom:20px">Questions parents ask</h2>
<details><summary>How does it start?</summary><p>A parent usually writes first. We follow with a call. Then the student meets their pediatrician in Blacksburg, long enough to start together. After that, they have the number.</p></details>
<details><summary>How soon can they be seen?</summary><p>Same week, and usually same day. A panel small enough that this stays true in November.</p></details>
<details><summary>Will you share my student's information with me?</summary><p>You get the standing rule you agree on. At 18 the chart is theirs. We write it down and follow it. Their hometown doctor gets the note the same afternoon.</p></details>
<details><summary>Does this replace insurance?</summary><p>No. Membership is not insurance. Keep your student's coverage for labs, specialists, and emergencies.</p></details>
<details><summary>What if my student is away from Blacksburg?</summary><p>In-person care in Blacksburg is the core. Tele visits when a room is not required.</p></details>
<details><summary>What if it's an emergency?</summary><p>Call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room. Then let us know in the morning, and we'll help with follow-up.</p></details>
<p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="btn" href={href("join")}>Reserve a spot</a></p></div></section>
</Layout>
